SUMMARY:Blue Angels Practice + Autographs
DESCRIPTION:The Blue Angels fly a Wednesday practice over the National Nav
 al Aviation Museum's flight line at NAS Pensacola\, and team members then
  visit the museum to answer questions and sign autographs. The flight-lin
 e gates open at 9:30 AM\, the jets are scheduled up at about 10:30 AM\, a
 nd the flight\, the autographs and the museum are all free. This is the l
 ast practice on the museum's 2026 schedule. Base entry pauses once the mu
 seum lot is full\, so plan to arrive early.\nPrice: Free\nArea: Pensacola
 \nTimes: Wednesday 10/28 · gates 9:30 AM\, practice ~10:30 AM\, autograp
 hs after\nChecked against the venue's own page on 2026-10-17\nhttps://coa
 staleventures.com/events/ev-blues-1028.html
LOCATION:National Naval Aviation Museum flight line\, 1750 Radford Blvd\, 
 NAS Pensacola\, FL 32508
URL:https://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-blues-1028.html
END:VEVENT
